40
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:39,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Hey, hey!
What's up with that?!</font>

41
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry,
those are the rules.</font>

42
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why, nee-chan, tell me why?</font>

43
00:01:41,950 --> 00:01:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, this is a hospital.
Keep it down.</font>

44
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey!
I've got a favor to ask!</font>

45
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:49,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to say it all.</font>

46
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I thought it would
come to this so...</font>

47
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I searched for someone
to watch your training.</font>

48
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

49
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to, Kakashi-sensei!</font>

50
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:01,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have some matters
to take care of.</font>

51
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have time to
trouble myself with you.</font>

52
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Aha...!</font>

53
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to
train Sasuke, aren't you?!</font>

54
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... don't say that.</font>

55
00:02:14,110 --> 00:02:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found a sensei who's
more reliable than I am!</font>

56
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:19,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... who is it?</font>

57
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me!</font>

58
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

59
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

60
00:02:24,450 --> 00:02:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

61
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Closet Perv!</font>

62
00:02:27,210 --> 00:02:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such insolence!</font>

63
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:35,250
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ebisu Returns!</font>

64
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:35,250
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I Will Not Allow</font>

65
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:35,250
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shamelessness!</font>

66
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ebisu-sensei is
a Closet Perv?</font>

67
00:02:45,350 --> 00:02:49,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's this guy
my training teacher?!</font>

68
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place,
he's weaker than me!</font>

69
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:54,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

70
00:02:54,190 --> 00:02:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you see! But you see!</font>

71
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time ago,
with my Harem Jutsu, this guy...</font>

72
00:02:59,610 --> 00:03:00,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

73
00:03:01,070 --> 00:03:04,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ebisu-sama! Ebisu-sama!</font>

74
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-By any chance...</font>

75
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Harem Jutsu?</font>

76
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Uh... it's nothing!</font>

77
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll treat you to and buy you
whatever you want later!</font>

78
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just be quiet about that!</font>

79
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You better.</font>

80
00:03:29,770 --> 00:03:33,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, I didn't know you
were acquainted.</font>

81
00:03:34,730 --> 00:03:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, they're unsavory ties, but.</font>

82
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could I ever forget
that humiliation?</font>

83
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why this guy?</font>

84
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I definitely don't want him to.</font>

85
00:03:46,990 --> 00:03:48,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same here.</font>

86
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it weren't Kakashi-kun's favor,
who'd teach you for the fun of it?</font>

87
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then don't.</font>

88
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now now, both of you...</font>

89
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that.</font>

90
00:03:57,550 --> 00:04:00,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Ebisu-sensei is a private tutor</font>

91
00:04:00,130 --> 00:04:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who teaches the elite,
a special Jonin!</font>

92
00:04:04,050 --> 00:04:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's truly better
at teaching than I am.</font>

93
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, Naruto, of the three kids
in Team 7 that I taught,</font>

94
00:04:15,650 --> 00:04:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're the worst at the basic skills.</font>

95
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get taught with care
this time around.</font>

96
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How the hell am I inferior
compared to Sakura-chan and Sasuke?!</font>

97
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, it's fact that you
don't have the fundamentals down.</font>

98
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what you do,
the basic skills are important.</font>

99
00:04:36,710 --> 00:04:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you really want to become strong,
just be quiet and listen to what I say.</font>

100
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, Ebisu-sensei,
I'm leaving him with you.</font>

101
00:04:48,010 --> 00:04:49,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes.</font>

102
00:04:49,850 --> 00:04:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

103
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It may appear to be harsh,</font>

104
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:56,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you can become a lot more stronger.</font>

105
00:04:58,270 --> 00:04:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do your best.</font>

106
00:05:01,610 --> 00:05:03,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, then, let's go.</font>

107
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still, I'm not convinced...</font>

108
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:09,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

109
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You see!</font>

110
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fundamentals might be important,</font>

111
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I won't get strong being taught
by someone weaker than me!</font>

112
00:05:19,130 --> 00:05:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So in other words,
you want to say that I'm weak?</font>

113
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who else is here?!</font>

114
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was certainly surprised having
that indecent Jutsu used on me that time.</font>

115
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's premature for you to
judge my ability on just that.</font>

116
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though you were
totally knocked out.</font>

117
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine.</font>

118
00:05:41,690 --> 00:05:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, why don't we put
it to the test?</font>

119
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

120
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:47,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, run.</font>

121
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

122
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can outrun me,
I'll back down quietly.</font>

123
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back down...?</font>

124
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

125
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:01,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And of course, I'll speak to
Kakashi-sensei</font>

126
00:06:01,170 --> 00:06:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about you receiving direct training.</font>

127
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Really?!</font>

128
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:10,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This elite instructor does not
go back on his word.</font>

129
00:06:10,550 --> 00:06:13,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this is only if
you can outrun me.</font>

130
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that makes it easy!</font>

131
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See ya!</font>

132
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This'll be a snap, a snap!</font>

133
00:06:30,450 --> 00:06:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll lose that...
Closet Perv in no time!</font>

134
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He already can't catch up!</font>

135
00:06:43,290 --> 00:06:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew I was quite
an exceptional Ninja...</font>

136
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is exceptional, you say?</font>

137
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surely you're not thinking you can
outrun me with just that much.</font>

138
00:06:58,390 --> 00:06:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What're you saying?!</font>

139
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:01,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The chase has still...</font>

140
00:07:03,730 --> 00:07:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only just begun!</font>

141
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though he's a Closet Perv,</font>

142
00:07:25,710 --> 00:07:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's the elite tutor after all,
he's good.</font>

143
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then.</font>

144
00:08:01,210 --> 00:08:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew you were a Closet Perv.</font>

145
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing...?</font>

146
00:08:09,590 --> 00:08:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun?</font>

147
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:16,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. The idea isn't bad.</font>

148
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:20,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, how about this?!</font>

149
00:08:20,850 --> 00:08:22,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

150
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh!</font>

151
00:08:27,730 --> 00:08:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Catch me... if you can!</font>

152
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:35,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not bad...</font>

153
00:08:36,660 --> 00:08:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, you are not the only one
who uses the Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

154
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

155
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

156
00:08:59,930 --> 00:09:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Son... of... a...!</font>

157
00:09:17,990 --> 00:09:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, next.</font>

158
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

159
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found you!</font>

160
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

161
00:09:40,390 --> 00:09:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you
get away!</font>

162
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get off!</font>

163
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!
No, actually, here!</font>

164
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

165
00:09:46,310 --> 00:09:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!
There!</font>

166
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

167
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you reached your limit?</font>

168
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're freaking pesky!</font>

169
00:10:09,130 --> 00:10:11,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up already!</font>

170
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you snapping
back at me for?</font>

171
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:16,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a chase, so chasing
is natural, right?</font>

172
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-True enough...</font>

173
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:24,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, you have understood
my greatness by now, right?</font>

174
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time you surrendered
and moved on to training...</font>

175
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The hell with that!</font>

176
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to bump you off,
and receive Kakashi-sensei's training!</font>

177
00:10:37,610 --> 00:10:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I have to knock you out!</font>

178
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:43,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears you still have
some spirit left.</font>

179
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he would come at me
head on, even though this is a chase.</font>

180
00:10:51,130 --> 00:10:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I would expect of you, Naruto-kun.</font>

181
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:57,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As Kakashi-kun said, he's the
most unpredictable Ninja.</font>

182
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't take this badly!</font>

183
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

184
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu...?</font>

185
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The game is over, Naruto-kun!</font>

186
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

187
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Miso-flavor barbecued pork noodles and
salt-flavor ramen noodles!</font>

188
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go!</font>

189
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, having been shown
your movements and</font>

190
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">having further analyzed
what Kakashi-sensei has told me...</font>

191
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it is clear that you cannot control
Chakra well.</font>

192
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Control...?</font>

193
00:11:52,350 --> 00:11:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

194
00:11:53,650 --> 00:11:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, comparing you
with Sasuke-kun and Sakura-kun...</font>

195
00:11:57,570 --> 00:12:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall explain your
bad points in order.</font>

196
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you know, in the case of using
Ninjutsu, Genjutsu and the like,</font>

197
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja build up Chakra and
activate the Jutsu.</font>

198
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I know that already!</font>

199
00:12:12,830 --> 00:12:13,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

200
00:12:14,170 --> 00:12:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, in the case of comparing
the three of you,</font>

201
00:12:17,460 --> 00:12:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall explain specifically
how you are inferior.</font>

202
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's kind of an irritating
way of saying it.</font>

203
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm treating you the ramen
as promised,</font>

204
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:28,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so be quiet and listen!</font>

205
00:12:29,770 --> 00:12:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, let us say that Sakura
uses Clone Jutsu.</font>

206
00:12:33,730 --> 00:12:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu!</font>

207
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:43,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In her case, her build-up control as well as
her control of Chakra is perfect,</font>

208
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so she can make clones without
using wasteful energy.</font>

209
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

210
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, in Sasuke-kun's case,</font>

211
00:12:51,870 --> 00:12:55,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he is somewhat poor at
building up Chakra.</font>

212
00:12:56,670 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu.</font>

213
00:13:02,130 --> 00:13:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, his control of Chakra is perfect,</font>

214
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so both he and Sakura-kun can
make five clones.</font>

215
00:13:10,850 --> 00:13:15,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, he uses a bit more wasteful
Chakra than Sakura-kun.</font>

216
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

217
00:13:16,730 --> 00:13:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Sasuke's nothing special.</font>

218
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In your case, there's no time
to be laughing at others.</font>

219
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

220
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:30,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are very poor at building up Chakra
and controlling it,</font>

221
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:33,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so you cannot make clones
with the same amount of Chakra.</font>

222
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the case where you strain to
make clones despite that,</font>

223
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after consuming a much larger amount
of Chakra than Sakura-kun and Sasuke-kun...</font>

224
00:13:42,210 --> 00:13:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu!</font>

225
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...you can barely make
one clone at best.</font>

226
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way,</font>

227
00:13:51,010 --> 00:13:55,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-kun and Sasuke-kun can become ten
with the same amount of Chakra.</font>

228
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like this, the three of you are
this different even using the same Jutsu.</font>

229
00:14:08,070 --> 00:14:12,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this is a somewhat exaggerated
comparison of you three,</font>

230
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:16,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you build up too much Chakra,
use too much physical strength,</font>

231
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and your Jutsu activation is also unstable.</font>

232
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, there've been times when
I was greater than Sakura-chan and Sasuke...</font>

233
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:24,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's only because you
happen to have</font>

234
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:28,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the most outstanding stamina
of the three!</font>

235
00:14:31,350 --> 00:14:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I am pretty sure that
your Chakra control</font>

236
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:37,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is getting difficult due to the influence
of the Nine-Tails...</font>

237
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:40,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which is the origin of your stamina.</font>

238
00:14:42,310 --> 00:14:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, there is no mistaking
that you can become strong</font>

239
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you carry out the training
we will be doing from now.</font>

240
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Really?!</font>

241
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guarantee it.</font>

242
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, let's go.</font>

243
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:56,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sir, your bill.</font>

244
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right.</font>

245
00:14:58,500 --> 00:14:59,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

246
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:08,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much!</font>

247
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've come quite a long way...</font>

248
00:15:20,190 --> 00:15:22,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, this is a hot spring town, right?</font>

249
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:26,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't look like we've come
here to leisurely soak in a hot spring...</font>

250
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Naruto-kun!</font>

251
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the women's bath!</font>

252
00:15:30,490 --> 00:15:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I simply will not allow
indecent behavior!</font>

253
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

254
00:15:36,990 --> 00:15:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not you...</font>

255
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that I was trying to peep.</font>

256
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking of something like that
in the first place makes you a Closet Perv!</font>

257
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with that look?</font>

258
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Nothing.</font>

259
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:54,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, why've we come
to a place like this?!</font>

260
00:15:55,180 --> 00:15:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will soaking in a hot spring
do anything for training?</font>

261
00:15:58,100 --> 00:15:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

262
00:15:58,970 --> 00:16:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The training will be here
in this hot spring area!</font>

263
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, this is the place.</font>

264
00:16:08,070 --> 00:16:10,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a bath, sure enough!</font>

265
00:16:10,570 --> 00:16:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

266
00:16:12,450 --> 00:16:14,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said this is training, didn't I?
Training!</font>

267
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to train here?</font>

268
00:16:17,870 --> 00:16:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell are we going to do?</font>

269
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Walk on this hot water!</font>

270
00:16:26,250 --> 00:16:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

271
00:16:29,630 --> 00:16:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

272
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Walk on hot water?</font>

273
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you really do that?</font>

274
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:38,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course!</font>

275
00:16:39,810 --> 00:16:41,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard from Kakashi-sensei.</font>

276
00:16:42,310 --> 00:16:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You already did tree-climbing training
without using your hands, right?</font>

277
00:16:46,310 --> 00:16:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an application of that.</font>

278
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...
What do you mean?</font>

279
00:16:50,110 --> 00:16:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, I don't really remember
stuff from long ago!</font>

280
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In tree climbing, all you do
is accumulate</font>

281
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only the necessary amount of Chakra
in one necessary location</font>

282
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and maintain that amount of
Chakra all the while.</font>

283
00:17:01,950 --> 00:17:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trees are fixed objects,
so you only need to be attached to it.</font>

284
00:17:07,330 --> 00:17:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

285
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:11,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's training for building up
a fixed amount of Chakra.</font>

286
00:17:12,550 --> 00:17:14,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To float on the surface of water,</font>

287
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have to discharge on
a constant basis</font>

288
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an appropriate amount of Chakra
from your feet to the water</font>

289
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and balance that to the extent that
you can float your own body.</font>

290
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:24,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

291
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Chakra control is
more difficult than maintaining...</font>

292
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:32,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is a control training for
discharge and usage of fixed amount</font>

293
00:17:32,990 --> 00:17:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of Chakra for Jutsu and alike.</font>

294
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, I really don't get it!</font>

295
00:17:38,370 --> 00:17:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it would be better to
show you in your case.</font>

296
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, you build up Chakra
in your feet.</font>

297
00:17:46,670 --> 00:17:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, while constantly discharging
a fixed amount...</font>

298
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you balance it with your body weight.</font>

299
00:17:56,090 --> 00:17:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

300
00:17:57,470 --> 00:17:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">well, this is how it goes.</font>

301
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Okay!
I'm going to try!</font>

302
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, you build up Chakra
in your feet.</font>

303
00:18:08,230 --> 00:18:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then!</font>

304
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Discharge a fixed amount. Right?</font>

305
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

306
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it.</font>

307
00:18:13,980 --> 00:18:15,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot, hot, hot, hot!</font>

308
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I forgot to mention it,
but this hot water is 60°C.</font>

309
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do nothing but fail...</font>

310
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:23,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will become a boiled octopus!</font>

311
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

312
00:18:26,870 --> 00:18:28,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it no matter what!</font>

313
