317
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've stopped doing that now!</font>

318
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

319
